{%- comment -%}
	AJAX endpoint section for lazy-loading tab collection cards.

	This section renders just the <div class="swiper-slide"> elements for a
	single collection's product cards. The parent section already contains the
	.swiper container, .swiper-wrapper, and prev/next arrow SVGs — so this
	endpoint only needs to supply the slides themselves.

	The JS handler injects the response into the existing .swiper-wrapper via
	innerHTML, then initializes (or re-initializes) Swiper.

	It is designed to be fetched via:
	  /collections/{handle}?section_id=index-tab-collections-lazy-cards&limit=...

	URL parameters:
	  - section_id: "index-tab-collections-lazy-cards" (standard Shopify param; tells Shopify
	      to render this section in isolation).
	  - limit: Number of products to render (read via cv-url-param.liquid).
	      Defaults to 12.

	The collection object is provided automatically by Shopify when the URL path
	is /collections/{handle}.

	Card-product render parameters ({% render 'card-product' %}):
	  - card_product:         The product object from collection.products loop.
	  - media_aspect_ratio:   "adapt" (hardcoded; matches homepage config).
	  - image_shape:          "default" (hardcoded; matches homepage config).
	  - show_secondary_image: true (hardcoded; matches homepage config).
	  - show_vendor:          false (hardcoded; matches homepage config).
	  - show_rating:          false (hardcoded; matches homepage config).
	  - section_id:           section.id — this section's own ID. The original
	                          sections pass block.id here, but since this endpoint
	                          has no blocks the section ID is used instead. It is
	                          only used for DOM scoping within the card.
	  - quick_add:            "none" (hardcoded; matches homepage config).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} --- Read URL parameters --- {%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture limit_raw -%}{%- render 'cv-url-param', param_name: 'limit' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign limit_str = limit_raw | strip -%}
{%- if limit_str != blank -%}
	{%- assign product_limit = limit_str | plus: 0 -%}
{%- else -%}
	{%- assign product_limit = 12 -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
	Shopify provides `collection` automatically when the URL is
	/collections/{handle}?section_id=index-tab-collections-lazy-cards
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if collection != blank and collection.products.size > 0 -%}
	{%- for product in collection.products limit: product_limit -%}
		<div class="swiper-slide product__grid-item">
			{% content_for 'block', type: '_product-card', id: 'static-product-card', closest.product: product %}
		</div>
	{%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
	"name": "Tab Collection Cards",
	"settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
